-- A deterministic leading argument before the witnessed one: the body factor is
-- mk's probability function called with both (task
-- named-function-list-head-witness-not-recovered). p([a, b]) = phi(a) phi(b - a - 1).
p([0.0, 1.0])=(0.15915494, 2.0, False)
p([1.0, 1.0])=(0.05854983, 2.0, False)
p([0.0, ANY])=(0.39894228, 1.0, False)
